        <p>P, ITTS'S RENOWNED HOUSES OF FURNITURE at 15i, 22.. i. 284. 34. 50. 75. 100 up to 1000 guineas are at the prices l lib VIIHY BEST THAT MONEY CAN BUY not only for the QUANTITY of articles bnt mere especially for the QUALITY thereof. Full particulars. Press opinions, and Testimonials on application. Cub prices only quoted, deferred payment by arrangement.</p>
        <p>PITTS'S FOR DINING-ROOM FURNITURE.—SpIendid Suite, American walnut, in rich Utrecht velvet, cost £45, for £l5 108, handsome Sideboard to match, cost £25, for £lO 10e. Extending Dining Table, cast £7 for £.3 3s. Grand Suite, American walnut and Arabian saddlebags. cost 55 guineas, for £lB. Magnificent Br 3wn Oak Suite, in real Morocco leather, cost 60 guineas, for 25 guineas. Colossal solid Oak Sideboard to match, profusely carved, cost £B5. lot £35. Serviceable Saito In real leather, £7 108., cost £2O. An- other In velvet, £8 Bs. coat £22. Scores to select fro= at ex- ceptionally low prices.</p>
        <p>PITTS FOR DRAWING ROOM FURNITURE. Exquisite Chippendale Suite, solid rosewood, beautifully inlaid, cost £.55. for 24 guineas. Overmantel to match, Cost £l5, for 6 guineas. Also Cabinet. cost £55. for 20 guineas. Italian Walnut Suite, in rich velvet, cost £35, for 15 guineas. One in tapestry cost £3O. for 12 guineas. Another in embossed ve'vet, cost £2l for 8 guineas. Sitting-room Suite complete, eost £2O, for 9 guineas, bas couch, two easy and small chairs in Mahogany. or hair and leather; sideboard, table. carpet, fender, and fire brasses. The Greatest Bargain ever offered.</p>
        <p>PIITS FOR BEDROOM FURNITURE.—Grand Solid American Walnut Suite, complete. cost £65, for 25 runes&amp; Splendid Satin Walnut Suite, cost £45, for 18 guineas. Ash Suite,cost £2s.for 11 guineas, Entire contents of Bedroom for 7 guineas, worth double, contains wardrobe, pair of toilet tables, chest of drawers, pedestal cupboard, towsl rail, three chairs, toilet glass,brass mounted bedstead, mattresses, wool bed, bolster, two pillows, carpet, fender. and toilet ware, all complete. Massive all brass Bedstead. coat £lO, for 5 guinereas. Brass mounted Bedsteads, spring arid wool mattresses,full size and quality, for 2} gnineas,well worth double. 11110ITTSI3 OFFICE AND LIBRARY FURNITURE has I stood pre-eminent for over fifty years. Largest, best, and cheapest stock. Every description of Desks, Tables, Stools, Chairs, Bookcases, trees, Copying Presses, at about bait city prices, at</p>
